{{div col|colwidth=24em}}

*''[[Racomitrium geronticum]]'' {{small|Müll.Hal.}}
*''[[Racomitrium lanuginosum]]'' {{small|(Hedw.) Brid.}}
*''[[Racomitrium patagonicum]]'' {{small|Bedn.-Ochyra & Ochyra}}
*''[[Racomitrium pruinosum]]'' {{small|(Wilson) Müll.Hal.}}
*''[[Racomitrium pseudopatens]]'' {{small|(Müll.Hal.) Paris}}
